# Private payloads consumed through requireFile: register them with
# `nix-store --add-fixed sha256 <file>` instead of tracking them here.  Three
# are still required, and local copies of all three live in this directory -
# they are the durable copy, because no GC root holds the store paths:
#   liuqin-firmware-vpu.tar.zst and liuqin-firmware-cs35l41.tar.zst
#   (hashes in pkgs/firmware.nix), liuqin-ssc-config.tar.zst
#   (hash in config/example.nix).
# The other liuqin-firmware-* archives were replaced by the firmware tree in
# the downstream release's boot.img (pkgs/firmware.nix), so local copies of
# them are stale.
# The stock-*.tar.zst archives are NOT listed: pkgs/bootimg/stock-*.nix imports them
# with builtins.path, so they must stay in the tree for a boot image to build.
data/liuqin-*.tar.zst
